://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/acadia-pharmaceuticals-inc-acad-q4-2018-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"ACAD 2019 Q1","e":"acad","d":"2019-05-01","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Michael Yang","x":"We believe this growth was due to the awareness built by our DTC campaign, showing the potential positive benefits of Nuplazid as a treatment for PDP patients.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/acadia-pharmaceuticals-acad-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"ACAD 2019 Q1","e":"acad","d":"2019-05-01","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Michael Yang","x":"We believe this reflects our continued growth in new patient starts and continued expansion of our prescriber base, driven by the response to our DTC campaign and our customer-facing field force.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/acadia-pharmaceuticals-acad-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"ACAD 2019 Q2","e":"acad","d":"2019-07-31","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Michael Yang","x":"Principal drivers of growth were the completion of the 34 milligram transition of the 17 milligram tablets and a successful brand DTC campaign.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/acadia-pharmaceuticals-acad-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"ACAD 2019 Q2","e":"acad","d":"2019-07-31","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Elena Ridloff","x":"The decrease was primarily due to timing of DTC advertising expense, versus the prior year partially offset by an increase in personnel costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/acadia-pharmaceuticals-acad-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"ACAD 2019 Q2","e":"acad","d":"2019-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jason Butler","x":"Do you feel like you have the right size and structure of the sales force to capture that?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/acadia-pharmaceuticals-acad-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"ACAD 2019 Q3","e":"acad","d":"2019-10-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Michael Yang","x":"…useful for PDP; continuing to close the awareness gaps for PDP and Nuplazid with our integrated direct-to-consumer strategy, which includes digital trend and in-office assets, and our recently deployed television commercials. Alongside these efforts, ACADIA is sponsoring the Michael J. Fox…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/acadia-pharmaceuticals-acad-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"ACAD 2019 Q3","e":"acad","d":"2019-10-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Elena Ridloff","x":"This increase was largely due to higher direct-to-consumer advertising expense, charitable contribution and personnel costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/acadia-pharmaceuticals-acad-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"ACAD 2019 Q3","e":"acad","d":"2019-10-30","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Elena Ridloff","x":"With regard to DTC spend, we don't break that out specifically.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/acadia-pharmaceuticals-acad-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"ACAD 2019 Q3","e":"acad","d":"2019-10-30","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Elena Ridloff","x":"We've had an effort this year, which has been supported by a very positive ROI, and so we will continue to assess those investments and invest appropriately in DTC, but we haven't broken out the specific dollars.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/acadia-pharmaceuticals-acad-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"ACAD 2019 Q4","e":"acad","d":"2020-02-26","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Marc Goodman","x":"Also, can you give us a sense of, for direct-to-consumer advertising, will you be spending an equal amount of money in 2020 as you did in 2019?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/27/acadia-pharmaceuticals-acad-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"ACAD 2019 Q4","e":"acad","d":"2020-02-26","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Elena Ridloff","x":"We don't specifically comment on our DTC spend.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/27/acadia-pharmaceuticals-acad-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"ACAD 2019 Q4","e":"acad","d":"2020-02-26","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Steve Davis","x":"Just with respect to the DTC campaign, if there are any new learnings or observations that you've seen in the second one compared to the first.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/27/acadia-pharmaceuticals-acad-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"ACAD 2020 Q1","e":"acad","d":"2020-05-07","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Michael Yang","x":"For example, leveraging technology to conduct peer-to-peer educational programs and product theaters, launched our online treatment form that is optimized for the telemedicine paradigm.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/acadia-pharmaceuticals-acad-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"ACAD 2020 Q1","e":"acad","d":"2020-05-07","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Michael Yang","x":"We've had product theaters that are very well-attended.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/acadia-pharmaceuticals-acad-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"ACAD 2021 Q2","e":"acad","d":"2021-08-06","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Charmaine Lykins","x":"Our DTC and digital platforms activate those patients to request NUPLAZID by name.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/acadia-pharmaceuticals-inc-acad-q2-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"ACAD 2021 Q2","e":"acad","d":"2021-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Andrea Tan","x":"With respect to the lowered guidance there, can you help us understand what proportion of that reduction is due to expected continued impact from the pandemic versus gross to net?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/acadia-pharmaceuticals-inc-acad-q2-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"ACAD 2021 Q3","e":"acad","d":"2021-11-08","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Brendan Teehan","x":"Slide 10 highlights our new direct-to-consumer campaign, which is intended to reach patients and caregivers at home and drive them to their physicians to have conversations about their symptoms of psychosis and treatment with NUPLAZID.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/09/acadia-pharmaceuticals-inc-acad-q3-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"ACAD 2021 Q3","e":"acad","d":"2021-11-08","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Charles Duncan","x":"Regarding the commercial question, I guess I'm thinking about the two new campaigns for HCPs and direct-to-consumer, and I think Brendan suggested that higher percentage of PDP diagnosis would be the goal.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/09/acadia-pharmaceuticals-inc-acad-q3-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"ACAD 2021 Q3","e":"acad","d":"2021-11-08","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Stephen R. Davis","x":"On the patient and caregiver front, we're in the process of launching a new DTC campaign aimed at solving one of our biggest COVID-related challenges, which is physicians not seeing as many PDP patients in-person.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/09/acadia-pharmaceuticals-inc-acad-q3-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"ACAD 2021 Q3","e":"acad","d":"2021-11-08","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Stephen R. Davis","x":"As such, this DTC campaign is aimed at patients and caregivers who are at home and is designed to activate them to have a conversation with their doctor about their symptoms of psychosis and potential treatment with NUPLAZID.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/09/acadia-pharmaceuticals-inc-acad-q3-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"ACAD 2025 Q3","e":"acad","d":"2025-11-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Catherine Owen Adams","x":"The impact of this field team expansion combined with our direct-to-consumer campaigns creates a powerful combination that we believe will drive sustained growth and value maximization for NUPLAZID.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/acadia-acad-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACAD 2025 Q3","e":"acad","d":"2025-11-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Tom Garner","x":"Our reach and frequency model is driving broader prescribing patterns across a wide range of HCPs, and our direct-to-consumer campaigns are raising awareness of PDP symptoms while highlighting NUPLAZID as the first and only approved treatment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/acadia-acad-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACAD 2025 Q3","e":"acad","d":"2025-11-05","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Catherine Owen Adams","x":"You know, I think as I came on board last year, in September, the team had just started their DTC communications, both the unbranded and the branded, and we weren't sure how impactful that was going to be.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/acadia-acad-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACAD 2025 Q3","e":"acad","d":"2025-11-05","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Catherine Owen Adams","x":"But, again, we hadn't really been in the DTC space for a while since pre-COVID, and we wanted to understand the impact of that type of DTC investment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/acadia-acad-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACAD 2025 Q3","e":"acad","d":"2025-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Tazeen Ahmad","x":"Maybe just wanted to ask about why you think now is the right time to add to the field force for NUPLAZID and how are you deciding, like, what is the right size?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/acadia-acad-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACAD 2025 Q4","e":"acad","d":"2026-02-25","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Thomas Garner","x":"On the direct-to-consumer front, our new branded campaign launched in the fourth quarter, and we expect pull-through benefits to build throughout 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/acadia-acad-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACAD 2025 Q4","e":"acad","d":"2026-02-25","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Thomas Garner","x":"Taken together, coupled with all of the efforts that we deployed in 2025—expanded field team, more direct-to-consumer, significant education especially as we move into the community setting—we believe there is an opportunity to further penetrate the Rett marketplace with DAYBUE and potentially…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/acadia-acad-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACAD 2026 Q1","e":"acad","d":"2026-05-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Thomas Garner","x":"In addition, we anticipate further benefits from our direct-to-consumer efforts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/acadia-acad-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ACAD 2026 Q1","e":"acad","d":"2026-05-06","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Thomas Garner","x":"We are also pushing on DTC efforts (both unbranded and branded) and have expanded our target universe to just over 10 thousand HCPs, which should support further share growth over coming quarters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/acadia-acad-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ACAD 2026 Q2","e":"acad","d":"2026-08-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Thomas Garner","x":"Our direct-to-consumer investments continue to be a meaningful driver of awareness, patient identification and activation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/acadia-pharmaceuticals-acad-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACAD 2026 Q2","e":"acad","d":"2026-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas Garner","x":"Taken together, these trends reinforce our confidence in DAYBUE's increased guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/acadia-pharmaceuticals-acad-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACAD 2026 Q2","e":"acad","d":"2026-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Elizabeth Thompson","x":"Also for DAYBUE, we are slightly increasing the guidance range for gross to net to 23% to 25%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/acadia-pharmaceuticals-acad-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACAD 2026 Q3","e":"acad","d":"2026-11-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Thomas Garner","x":"At the same time, our direct-to-consumer investment is expanding awareness of PDP and encouraging patients and caregivers to talk about symptoms and treatment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/acadia-pharma-acad-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ACAD 2026 Q3","e":"acad","d":"2026-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas Garner","x":"As Catherine noted, we are raising our full year guidance for DAYBUE and reiterating our confidence in our previously stated $700 million sales ambition for 2028.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/acadia-pharma-acad-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,8605,0,0,0,7445,661],[37,1,8735,0,0,0,6897,1399],[38,1,7126,0,0,0,5627,875],[39,1,9048,0,0,0,7312,1193],[40,1,8887,0,0,0,7110,1006],[41,1,9940,2,2,0,7957,1432],[46,1,10006,0,0,0,8117,1295],[47,1,10292,0,0,0,8342,1431],[63,1,9203,0,0,0,5755,2641],[64,1,9292,0,0,0,7336,779],[65,1,5600,0,0,0,4408,552],[66,1,9544,0,0,0,5606,3077],[67,1,8372,0,0,0,7292,619]],"cinema":[[36,1,8605,0,0,0,7445,661],[37,1,8735,0,0,0,6897,1399],[38,1,7126,0,0,0,5627,875],[39,1,9048,0,0,0,7312,1193],[40,1,8887,0,0,0,7110,1006],[41,1,9940,0,0,0,7957,1432],[46,1,10006,0,0,0,8117,1295],[47,1,10292,0,0,0,8342,1431],[63,1,9203,0,0,0,5755,2641],[64,1,9292,0,0,0,7336,779],[65,1,5600,0,0,0,4408,552],[66,1,9544,0,0,0,5606,3077],[67,1,8372,0,0,0,7292,619]],"imax":[[36,1,8605,0,0,0,7445,661],[37,1,8735,0,0,0,6897